# scratch test structures / session transcripts at repo root
/*.cif
/*.pdb
/context*.txt
# Ignore local .claude session data (worktrees, local settings) but track
# shared, checked-in skills and agents under .claude/skills/ and .claude/agents/.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/agents/
# Agent working memory is machine-specific (device UDIDs, signing team ID, local
# absolute paths) and must never be tracked — including in nested checkouts like
# swiftui/ that the root `.claude/*` rule above does not reach.
**/.claude/agent-memory/
.superpowers/
*-this-session-is-being-continued-*.txt
build_ios_dd/

